              "top": 150,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 118,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:18px;\">• Course objective: build a simple web page using HTML</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;\">• Target audience: complete beginners</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;\">• What you will learn: document structure, headings, links, images, lists, tables, forms, semantic HTML, best practices</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;\">• Course format: short lessons, quizzes, hands‑on activity</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
