            {
              "id": "text_NYRL8v2c",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 50,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 58,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:32px;\"><strong>Links and Images</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_38Oiyfz7",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 130,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 103,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:18px;\">• Use <code>&lt;a href=&quot;url&quot;&gt;link text&lt;/a&gt;</code> to create hyperlinks</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;\">• Use <code>&lt;img src=&quot;path&quot; alt=&quot;description&quot;&gt;</code> to embed images</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;\">• Remember to set <code>target=\"_blank\"</code> for external links</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "shape_AdXVpx2f",
              "type": "shape",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 260,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 120,
              "path": "M 0 0 L 1 0 L 1 1 L 0 1 Z",
              "viewBox": [
                1,
                1
              ],
              "fill": "#f5f5f5",
              "fixedRatio": false,
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_ZzPG6oBb",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 80,
              "top": 280,
              "width": 840,
              "height": 43,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:14px; font-family:monospace;\">&lt;a href=\"https://example.com\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;Visit Example&lt;/a&gt;<br/>&lt;img src=\"image.jpg\" alt=\"Sample Image\" width=\"200\"&gt;</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "shape_VvMHmVfh",
              "type": "shape",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 400,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 2,
              "path": "M 0 0 L 1 0 L 1 1 L 0 1 Z",
              "viewBox": [
                1,
                1
              ],
              "fill": "#cccccc",
              "fixedRatio": false,
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_muE90rsE",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_NYRL8v2c"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_fTJFGDlT",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "Alright, everyone, let's dive into adding links and images to our web pages. These two elements make a site interactive and visually engaging."
        },
        {
          "id": "action_QO0itkZs",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_38Oiyfz7"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_HBLI9QLM",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "First, the basic hyperlink syntax: we use the <a> tag with an href attribute. It looks like <a href=\"url\">link text</a>. Replace \"url\" with the destination address and \"link text\" with what you want users to click."
        },
        {
          "id": "action_EeJmoxDC",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_ZzPG6oBb"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_1vYqoHdG",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "Here's a concrete example that opens a new tab: <a href=\"https://example.com\" target=\"_blank\">Visit Example</a>. The target=\"_blank\" part tells the browser to open the link in a separate tab."
        },
        {
          "id": "action_BXO_V7SE",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_38Oiyfz7"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_Be_7vBxV",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "Notice the quotation marks around the URL and link text—always keep them paired, otherwise the browser gets confused."
        },
        {
          "id": "action_EBgVfUY1",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_ZzPG6oBb"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_7rosNSNm",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "Now, to embed an image, we use the <img> tag with a src attribute, like <img src=\"image.jpg\" alt=\"description\">. The alt attribute provides a text description for accessibility."
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1777564472805,
      "updatedAt": 1777564472805
    }
  ],
